  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together flour, cornstarch, nutmeg, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the minced chicken to the dry ingredients and mix until just combined.",
    "Stir in the chopped peanuts and grated ginger.",
    "Using your hands, shape the mixture into small patties.",
    "Heat about 1/2-inch of vegetable oil in a large non-stick skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "When the oil is hot, add 3-4 fritters to the skillet and fry until crispy and golden brown, about 3-4 minutes per side.",
    "Repeat with the remaining fritters.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
